<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Password Reset</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Password Reset Request</h1>
    <h2>Hello, {{name}}!</h2>
    <p>We received a request to reset your password for your PettyCash account.</p>
    <p>To reset your password, please <a href="{{resetLink}}">click here</a>.</p>
    <p>If you didn't request this password reset, please ignore this email or contact support.</p>
    <br>
    <small>This email was sent automatically. Please do not reply.</small>
  </body>
</html>